window.products.push({"id":804041,"name":"Milliard Twin Daybed and Fold- Up Trundle Set, Black Frame - Mattresses Sold Separately","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MUqV2sgtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Maximize Your Space: Our space saving daybed and pop-up trundle is ideal for small living spaces and guest bedrooms. It’s two beds when you need them, a comfy sitting area when you don’t – perfect for sleepover guests and slumber parties. Bed-Height Trundle: Hate sleeping just inches off the floor? With its exclusive design, our trundle bed easily raises to full height by lifting the legs, so you can enjoy a truly comfortable night’s sleep. Use the beds separately or arrange them side-by-side and top with a king-sized mattress for an instant king bed! Modern Design: With its sophisticated black metal frame and attached head and foot boards, our daybed is truly multi-functional, suitable for both sitting and sleeping. Trundle bed can be wheeled in both high and low positions, and legs can be quickly and easily raised to reach the height of the daybed. Made to Last: Built from durable materials, our beds are made to last. Beds have a maximum weight limit of 350 lb. each and are 100% compliant with all US safety regulations. The trundle features locking wheels for added safety. Simple Assembly means your bed will be ready for use in no time at all. Daybed and trundle accommodate two twin sized mattresses (NOT included), and trundle can fit a mattress up to 9.5” thick. Beds are ready to use as-is – no box spring required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MUqV2sgtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Milliard","source_asin":"B0BK9WYCBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK9WYCBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK9WYCBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
