window.products.push({"id":804250,"name":"Sous Vide Cooker Ultra-Quiet: Color LCD Recipes IPX7 Waterproof Circulator Cooker Brushless DC Motor 1100 Watts Immersion Circulator Include Sous Vide","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aqBhFloZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Original recipes helps cooking professionally】The sous vide cooker's Ultra-clear LCD displays 20 original healthy recipes created by famous restaurant chefs and 5 custom recipes customized to your preferences.The recipe sets the perfect temperature and time for hot spring eggs, steak, lamb chops and other ingredients, so that you can easily cook the perfect taste of professional chef at home. 【Accurate cooking by thermostat control 】The sous vide machine's thermostat control, which is accurate to 0.1F, keeps you from overcooking or undercooking. You precisely set the water to a preferred temperature and cooking time, then you get the doneness you desire. You can also use the preset function to get perfect cooking results, which also saves your time Temperature control range: 104℉~194℉(40℃~90℃), temperature accuracy: 0.1℉/0.1℃. 【High-end UAV class super power material】The sous vide adopts brushless DC motor of the same quality as high-end UAV, with uniform rotation of 3800r/m. It is ultra-quiet and more durable, and has better performance than better the previous generation. 【Super water flow&Heated evenly】The 20L/min design of immersion circulator increases the internal circulation speed of water and ensures the stability of temperature in each place.This allows you to put more ingredients in the same pot at the same time, and you don't have to worry about uneven temperatures that will influence the food from heating properly. 【Safe and no noise】The whole part of the sous vide touching the water is made of SUS304 stainless steel, which will not cause the product's material to become yellow due to the long use time, and it is safe and durable.The wave wheel adopts a 135 degree inclination Angle design, with the elliptical hole of the sleeve, to reduce the noise. 【Easy to clean and waterproof】The touch panel of the suvee cooker , which is IPX7 certified waterproof, allows you to wash the entire body in water, you can deeply clean grease stains from every crevice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aqBhFloZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenBoss","source_asin":"B09L6SLV6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L6SLV6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L6SLV6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
