window.products.push({"id":804291,"name":"Defrosting Tray for Frozen Meat Defrosting Tray -Thawing Tray for Frozen Meat Thawing Board Defrosting Board for Frozen Meat Thawing Tray for Frozen M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k5p2cYmML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️Miracle Thaw -The hollow bottom design of the defrost board accelerates the heat exchange between air significantly speeding up thawing. In addition to defrost tray can collect the thawing water to prevent the liquid overflowing off the plate and spreading across your kitchen counter. ✔️Large Size -The size of our thawing plate for frozen meat is: 11.8 in * 8.7 in. The large surface enables you to thaw multiple items simultaneously, such as meat, bacon, chicken, steak, fish, fruit, and vegetables. This defroster plate for meat is coated with non-stick material and is easy to clean. ✔️Good Quality -The defroster plate for meat is made of aluminum alloy. Thick aluminum alloy material is durable and can resist bending or warping, in addition, it has thermal conductivity, which can accelerate the speed of food defrosting. Large size of thaw plate for frozen meat is faster than small, which will save you more time when cooking. ✔️Natural Thaw -Instead of using hot water, electricity, and microwave oven to defrost rapidly, it is a healthy way to use our food defroster tray to thaw meat or frozen food quickly and naturally, while retaining the necessary Vitamins and Nutrients of the food, and retaining the original flavor of the food to the greatest extent. This fast defrosting tray can miracle thaw！ ✔️Lifetime Warranty -The thawing board for frozen meat is a purely physical defrosting method, which does not require electricity, and is more energy-saving and safer. The 0.99-inch thickened large defrost plate with hollow bottom can thaw faster than other meat thawing tray. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and we will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k5p2cYmML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INPARALLUV","source_asin":"B0C546NX79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C546NX79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C546NX79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
