window.products.push({"id":804487,"name":"PrettyCare Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 28Kpa Stick Vacuum with Powerful Brushless Motor, LED Touch Display, 45 Mins Long Runtime, Lightweight Vacuum Clea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xlyy9qjJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【28Kpa Super Powerful Brushless Motor】: PRETTYCARE cordless vacuum cleaner generates high-speed airflow with an upgraded powerful brushless motor and provides up to 28,000 Pa suction in maximum mode, which is very energy-saving and efficient, generates less heat and makes less noise , providing a quiet and pleasant experience. This cordless stick vacuum instantly picks up coffee beans, crumbs, pet hair, fine dust, and more. And the wireless vacuum cleaner is suitable for all floors, carpet, hardwood floor, tile floor, marble floor and so on. 【45 Mins Super Long Runtime & Removable Battery】: The stick vacuum cleaner can clean up to 2,000 square feet of house at one time; one full charge is enough to clean your interior, furniture and awkward corners; Two charging mode, the charging cable is directly inserted into the vacuum cleaner cordless or the battery is charged separately. 【LED Display & Touch Screen】: The rechargeable vacuum cleaner cordless is equipped with an LED display at a glance, which helps you know the current performance of the battery vacuum cleaner at a glance. The large touch screen LED control panel allows you to easily adjust the vacuum power, which is more convenient and worry-free than traditional button operation. The control panel displays battery level, suction performance, brush clogged alarm and suction clogged alarm. Regular cleaning and replacement of the filter is recommended. 【Lightweight & Versatility】: The main body of the vacuum cleaner only weighs 3.55 pounds, even if you lift it up for a long time to clean, you will not feel tired, suitable for all ages. Designed with an ergonomic handle to keep your wrists stress-free. Convert your stick vacuum cleaner cordless into a handheld, allowing you to easily clean crevices, ledges, blinds, and behind furniture for a single, pet hair vacuum cleaner that cleans your entire home. 【5-Stage Filtration & Easy to Clean Filter】: This cordless vacuum cleaner adopts new cyclone technology and high-density mesh structure, 5-stage filtration effectively separates dirt. The hardwood floor vacuum cleaner helps clean up to 99.99% of tiny dust particles as small as 0.1 microns. Also, to maintain the suction power of the cordless stick vacuum cleaner, it is recommended to clean and replace the filter regularly, the filter is very easy to remove for cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xlyy9qjJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PRETTYCARE","source_asin":"B0C22M8R1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C22M8R1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C22M8R1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
