window.products.push({"id":804546,"name":"One Boxes for 1st Birthday WITH 24 Balloons for 1 Year Old Party - Baby First Birthday Decorations Clear Cube Blocks 'ONE' Letters as Cake Smash Photo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sL4hY3plL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎈WE'VE MADE IT THICKER (350 GSM) - Inferior boxes that do not hold up, with the edges unseal before you even assemble and with little to no instructions given. But not ours, improved 350 GSM thickness card stock, coupled with premium glue applied and a printed professionally drafted decorations manual, will give you the best one boxes for 1st birthday that you're looking for! That's our promise... 🎈WITH 24 BALLOONS - Select the balloons color that fits your little one's birthday theme, from baby blue to baby pink or even safari, mermaid and pastels theme balloons. Noticed that many does not include balloons in their 'ONE' 1st birthday boxes and merely supplying the clear boxes, but not ours, consistent with our company mission to make parents lives easier with our premium and complete birthday party kit, we've included 24 balloons to complete the set. 🎈3 SETS OF 'ONE' LETTERS FOR BETTER COVERAGE - Yes that’s correct! There are 3 pieces of 'O', 3 pieces of 'N' and 3 pieces of 'E' letters included in our kit with strong self-adhesive applied to the back of the letter, this will give you a complete 'ONE' coverage as your baby's first birthday party decorations or photoshoot prop. (Note: You can choose to apply only the front view with 1 set of 'ONE', and use the other 2 sets of 'ONE' for other areas) 🎈 EASY, SIMPLE & PROFESSIONAL MANUAL - We understand that as a mom or dad preparing for your baby's 1 year old birthday party/photoshoot can be overwhelming, hence we do not provide confusing or hard to read instructions, the printed manual included is written and designed by professional that gives you intuitive illustrations with simple instructions. Also, we've included guidance on how big the balloons should be inflated for a perfect balloon boxes just like the product images! 🎈 GIFTABLE & PROTECTION BOX - This first birthday decorations balloons box makes a perfect and beautiful 1st birthday gift for your niece/nephew or your best friend's 1 year old birthday. It get delivered in a beautiful giftable box just like a birthday present box, additionally it offers a protection to ensure the content gets delivered without damages or dent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sL4hY3plL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartyHooman","source_asin":"B09SCMFC7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SCMFC7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SCMFC7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
