window.products.push({"id":804615,"name":"Homdox Hot Air Popcorn Popper, No Oil Popcorn Maker with Measuring Cup and Removable Lid, Healthy Snack, Great for Kids, Black(1200W)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fg2+DJQ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hot Air Popcorn Popper Health productivity belonging to the family!At a time when millions of people around the world are eating popcorn every day, there is also a small group of people dealing with the same thing with machines that ordinary people may never touched for a lifetime.This is a rather interesting thing. A brand-new Hot Air Popcorn Popper, can not only provide children with a natural snack, but also provide new fun for family activities, such as enjoying movies with friends or family with home-made popcorn without increasing calories! Product Specification: Color: Black Model: BH9801 Power: 1200W Weight: 1.204 kg Plug Type: US Plug Voltage: 110/120V Frequency: 60Hz Material: Metal, Plastic, Stainless Steel Product Size:7.3 x 6.1 x 11.8 inches Here are Some notes before using this Popcorn Popper: ✔ Please make sure to put in the right amount of kernels every time. If you put too many corn kernels at a time, it will scorch and and lead to waste. ✔ Please turn off the popcorn maker when popping stops about 5-8 seconds. Please pour out all remaining popcorn and kernels after use, so that it can offer you better user experience  when you use it next time. ✔ This is a home hot air popcorn machine, it can not directly add butter and sugar, after the flavor Popcorn has been, you can add condensed milk，butter or caramel. ✔ This popcorn maker has overheating protection function, the using interval should be more than 15 minutes. ✔ It is recommended to use the com kernels (Dried Kernels) for popcorn maker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fg2+DJQ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homdox","source_asin":"B08FDT7896","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FDT7896","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FDT7896","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
