window.products.push({"id":804736,"name":"William Bounds Rita Combo Mill - Salt Shaker and Pepper Grinder Combo - Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619ET9J53bL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Why pass the salt when you can pass the salt and pepper? Made in the USA, the Rita Combo Mill with red trim combines a salt shaker and pepper mill into a single elegant silhouette. Simply fill the top with table salt and the bottom with any of our savory pepper blends and never need to set one down for the other again. Add the flavor of freshly ground peppercorns with just a twist; then give the mill a quick shake to dispense salt. The Rita’s round body provides great grip, while the fully transparent acrylic mill makes it easy to tell when it’s time for a refill. With its unique three-step adjustment ring in red, anyone can easily choose from a fine, medium, or coarse grind. The exclusive William Bounds stainless steel and ceramic milling mechanism, with no interlocking parts, prevents the mill from jamming or wearing out. Designed to crush rather than grind ingredients, our milling mechanism maximizes the additional fresh flavor of pepper in any dish. There are many imitations, but don’t be fooled. The William Bounds, Ltd. Mill collections all started with a simple concept. Organic design with a modern twist. Friendly to the hand, pleasing to the eye and complementing traditional and modern tables alike. Since 1965, when William Bounds started the company, we have proudly manufactured quality products in the United States. Each salt and pepper mill we manufacture in the United States is produced and assembled with the same care and attention to detail that Mr. Bounds brought to our products way back in 1965. As with many of our products, we designed the Rita Combo Mill to exacting standards. We strive to create mills that work as beautifully as they look; made from the finest materials. The Rita Combo Mill is made to last a lifetime, and we stand behind it with a lifetime warranty. If the mechanism ever malfunctions, or you find a manufacturing fault, we will replace it. With the Rita Combo Mill, you can take pride in knowing you have purchased an American product of highest quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619ET9J53bL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"William Bounds","source_asin":"B075N2C18N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075N2C18N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075N2C18N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
