window.products.push({"id":804760,"name":"BPA-Free Yogurt Containers for Use With Instant Pot ULTRA and DUO60 Models-2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VtWyYKpBL._AC_SL1121_.jpg","description":"Making bunches of batches of yogurt in smaller yogurt makers is a lot of work. Ferment an entire gallon of homemade yogurt in your Instant Pot Ultra or DUO60. That’s enough yogurt for a week for your family. Large batches not only save time. Think of the money you’ll save by buying healthy fresh ingredients in bulk. Ever get disappointed when you end up with such a small amount of yogurt after all your time and effort? What makes our Yogurt Tubs unique and distinctive is they fit perfectly in the steel liner of your instant pot. You save time by fermenting and storing your homemade Yogurt in the same pot. Avoid the mess of scooping your yogurt into another container. Plus- you won’t have to clean twice as many containers. Speaking of cleaning, that’s easy too because these yogurt tubs are dishwasher safe. Where these tubs shine the brightest is when it comes to making Greek yogurt or yogurt cheese. Do you find you always end up with less Greek Yogurt than you expected? The secret is to start out with enough regular yogurt in the first place. When you start with a gallon of regular yogurt you end up with about two quarts of thick, creamy Greek yogurt. Plus- you can control the consistency. Thick like sour cream or extra-thick like cream cheese spread. Save the time and trouble of thawing leftovers before you can put them into the pot. With these tubs your frozen leftovers are already in the exact shape of your instant pot! Microwave (yes- the tubs are microwave safe) to loosen before putting them in the instant pot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VtWyYKpBL._AC_SL1121_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yo-green","source_asin":"B07Q258WCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q258WCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q258WCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
