window.products.push({"id":804825,"name":"Chicken Nuggets Throw Blankets for Boys and Girls Funny Food Chicken Nuggets Ketchup Pattern Blankets Super Soft Comfy Flannel throw blankets for Wint","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bmCUnQu0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Features: High-Quality Fabric: Just a Boy Who Loves Chicken Nuggets Cartoon Blanket Made Of 100% High-Grade Ultra-Soft Anti-Pilling Fleece Flannel For Excellent Warmth And Softness Which Has a , Soft Touch And No Ball. Gift Concept: Chicken Nuggets Flannel Throw Blanket Not Only For Sleeping, But Also For Reading, Relaxing, Wrapping, And Watching TV On The Sofa. It Is a Soft Blanket And Flannel Blanket That Can Be Used In Spring, Summer, Autumn And Winter. Great Gift Ideas For Family And Friends On Birthdays, Christmas, New Years, Holidays. .The Gentle Feel Makes Your Family Or Loved Ones Warm All Year Round. Even Pets Love It! Chicken Nuggets Throw Blanket Benefits: Keeps You Warm, But It Is Not Thick To The Point Where It Will Overheat You,Giving You The Perfectly-Balanced Versatile Throw Blanket.It's Non-Shedding And Prevents Allergy. Ideal For Those Who Are Allergic And Asthmatic!Warm Flannel Fleece Blankets Is Good For All Seasons. Size: There Are Two Sizes To Choose From, Suitable For Children, Boys And Girls，Teenagers! Size: 50 \"x 40\"In (Width: 102cm, Length: 127cm) Suitable For Kids. Size: 60 \"x 50\" In (Width: 127cm, Length: 153cm) Suitable For Teenagers. What You Get: Package Include: 1 x Chicken Nuggets Flannel Throw Blanket Satisfied Shopping Experience: Act Fast. If You Like Our Products, Add The Cart Immediately,We Will Do It For You! Guaranteed You Get a Satisfying Chicken Nuggets Blanket. Make Your Life More Enjoyable. Note: -Please Allow 1-3cm (0.4-1.18\") Difference Due To Manual Measurement And Slight Color Variation For Different Display Setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bmCUnQu0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Samanca","source_asin":"B09KTV1TF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KTV1TF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KTV1TF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":804826,"name":"FLIP AND TUMBLE 24-7 Premium Reusable Grocery Bag - Perfect Shopping Bag, Beach Bag, Travel Bag (Peacock)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kNms-K8hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HELP PROTECT THE ENVIRONMENT - Plastic shopping bags from different stores can accumulate really quickly and they ultimately get thrown away which is harmful to the environment. With Flip & Tumble's 24-7 bag, you can help save the environment because you never have to bring home plastic bags. The bag is reusable and machine-washable so you can use it daily and keep it for years to come. DESIGNED FOR YOUR CONVENIENCE - The Flip & Tumble reusable shopping bag is compact, lightweight, and best of all, foldable. This stretch compacting tote goes from bag to ball in seconds. It is simply stashable and always there when you need it. Just stash one or two Flip & Tumble bags in your purse or everyday bag and bring it with you everywhere you go. You’ll never get stuck at the checkout without a reusable bag again! HOLDS UP TO 35 POUNDS - You'll be amazed at how much you can fit in it and how much weight it can carry. The Flip & Tumble compact reusable shopping bag measures 12x14x5 inches with a 26-inch strap. The compacted bag has a 3-inch diameter (about the size of a peach). Go ahead and load them up with a bowling ball or two. Rated to hold 35 lbs, the bags are designed to carry the heaviest of loads. MODERN AND MULTIFUNCTIONAL - Our foldable tote bag is designed to look modern and stylish so that you can carry it like a regular bag wherever you go. It’s not just for grocery shopping. You can also use it as a travel bag, beach bag, or an extra bag. The single-strap shoulder style makes this the one bag that goes anywhere. The anti-slip shoulder patch keeps the bag from slipping off the shoulder and keeps the heavy loads feeling light. BUILT TO LAST - Made of tough and durable 100% ripstop polyester, our reusable shopping tote bag is built to last. The ripstop fabric uses a special reinforcing technique that makes it resistant to tearing and ripping. The bag has a seamless bottom and is triple-sewn from the handle to the body. The result is a lightweight yet sturdy bag made for everyday use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kNms-K8hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"flip & tumble","source_asin":"B07WTN7ZJ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WTN7ZJ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WTN7ZJ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
