window.products.push({"id":804835,"name":"Impress Life Valentine's Day Gnome String Lights, 10ft 30 LEDs, Battery USB Plug-in Powered with Remote Control, Indoor Fairy Lights for Home House Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NM6uW1LEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Special Gnome Icon Design】 10 ft sliver plated copper wire and 30 LED bulbs, the acorn icon size is 1.5\" x 0.8\" inch. The led string lights for indoor/covered outdoor use, easily set or wrap, safe and never go over heat (silver plated copper wire, longer life, meets IP64 requirement). WARNING: DO NOT soak battery box in water. 【Dimmable Remote Control & Automatic Timer & Auto Setting】1.Always bright mode; 2.Normally bright + Flicker mode; 3.Combination mode; 4.Flash mode; 5.Alternating breathing mode; 6.Chasing Mode; 7. Twinkle mode 8.Alternating star flash mode. 2/4/6/8 Timer. 【Special for Valentine's Day】 Gnome string light for interior and exterior walls, bedroom, widely used in clubs, pub, bar, banquet. Gnome string light is special designs for Valentine's Day, thanksgiving day, proposal, weddings, anniverasry celebrations, family parties etc. Create instant atmosphere for parties and entertaining Transform any area from ordinary to extraordinary. 【The meaning of LUCKY GNOME light string】In Sweden there is the gnome, which also known as a Tomte or Nisse. They are reputed to safeguard the farmer and his family against any misfortune.It was especially during the night that the tomte was actively being protective. It is customary to express acknowledgement to the tomte by leaving him a bowl of porridge on Christmas Eve. The belief in the tomte has been widespread in Scandinavian countries and to this day Sweden still has stories of him. 【Worry Free Purchase】 We offer quality nconditional Satisfaction guarantee. Any problem please CONTACT US immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NM6uW1LEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impress Life","source_asin":"B08NVGL7M5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NVGL7M5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NVGL7M5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
