window.products.push({"id":804898,"name":"Brielle 100-Percent Sateen Modal from Beech Sheet Set, King, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iJHd0mu5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brielle Sateen Modal Sheets offer a soft touch and sheen. What is Brielle??Brielle? is our exclusive home textiles brand. In Brielle? we distilled 60 years of expertise to deliver the best value in home textiles. We carry an extensive selection of bedding products with cotton, modal, tinsel / lyocell, bamboo fibers in sateen jersey, twill, and percale weaves. The selection of fabric, size and color options often are not offered by local stores and delivered to your door at your convenience. We also carry a wide selection of window panels. Whether you are shopping for a sheet set, window panels or bathrobe, Brielle? will deliver the best product for your money. Luxury bedding and home textiles for factory prices. Guaranteed. What is Modal? This bedding product is made of Modal which is a high strength fiber, famous for its silky softness. Modal has a refined smooth touch, excellent breathability and moisture management features. We used the Lenzing Modal?, Austrian produced Modal fiber, made of the natural cellulose from Beech wood trees of Europe. Lenzing Modal is manufactured with high sustainability and ecological standards. Austrians are known for their fancy high tech sport cars and idyllic mountain scenes. They did not fall short in the glamour department with this marvelous fiber. What is Sateen? Sateen is a type of weave incorporating more vertical than horizontal yarns, which results in an extremely soft fabric with a silky sheen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iJHd0mu5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brielle","source_asin":"B00EV6FYBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EV6FYBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EV6FYBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
