window.products.push({"id":804900,"name":"Beer Bong Double Header - USA MADE Extra Long 2.5 feet(30 in) kink free sturdy tube & Leakproof Valves - Includes Shotgun opener keychain tool - Premi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nnEXscosL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What makes us a Premium Beer Bong ? #1 Zero Impurities - Our premium tubes are MADE IN USA. - Our tubes are crystal clear and free of any impurities (unlike the murky tubes from our competition). - Our tubes stay clear forever and donot turn milky white with regular use - and are therefore very safe to drink with. #2 Zero Leak - Our valves have no leak points unlike the traditional plumber valves. - Our valves have longer stem thereby providing a tighter connection. This avoids any leaks. - Unlike our competition, hose clamps are not required to prevent leaks. #3 Zero Kinks - Our premium tubes are resistant to any kinks. - No hot water needed to remove any kinks. - The sturdy tubes are also resistant to stomping. #4 5ft Beer Bong - Easily converted to a 5 ft beer bong. #5 Extra Long Tubes - Our tubes are extra long (2.5 feet).  - They hold more beer than other shorter tubes. #6 Premium & Bigger Funnel - Our funnels are extra large and made from premium material.  - Our funnels can hold more beer than our competition. #7 Easy operation - Our valves are designed for easy 2 finger open/close operation. #8 Premium Connector - Our premium connector has longer stem and guarantees tighter fit.  - No Clamps required and guaranteed to never leak. #9 Also Includes - The double Beer Bong ships with a 4-in-1 Beer Shotgun Keychain bottle opener.  - Use it as a beer Shotgunning tool or as bottle opener or as a keychain or as a can opener.  - Please note that a random color will be sent - Red/Yellow/White/Blue/Black.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nnEXscosL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Party Like Sophia","source_asin":"B07CNMF2QY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CNMF2QY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CNMF2QY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
