window.products.push({"id":804920,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser,Touchless Stainless Steel Soap Dispenser, IR Infrared Motion Sensor Hand Free Dish Soap for Kitchen and Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lQHvneG2L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Keep Your Home and Surroundings Germ and Bacteria Free With this touch free soap dispenser, soap will dispense automatically when your hand is placed in front of its responsive infrared sensor! Far more HYGIENIC and CLEAN than a store-bought soap dispenser, you can rest easier knowing it will prevent the spread of germs and keep your children safe and healthy. Modern Design Fingerprint resistant and sleek, this hands free soap dispenser will look beautiful and clean for weeks! Uses Any Liquid Hand or Dish Soap The Automatic Soap Dispenser will use any liquid soap (non foaming dispenser) you have lying around the house. Also works great with any hand or body lotion! No need to purchase any special soap for this unit SPECIFICATIONS: Material: Stainless steel, premium PC + ABS plastic Container Capacity: 250ml/8oz Sensor Range: 0~6cm / 0~2.36in Power Supply: 4 x AAA Alkaline Batteries (not included) Product Dimensions: 8 x 4.3 x 3 inches Easy to set up automatic soap dispenser: 1. Place 4pcs AAA batteries, then assemble cover 2. Unlock the top cover by turning it anti-clockwise. Fill the sanitizer you want to, then close the cover. Note: NOT contain solid particles to avoid clogging. 3. To switch on, press and hold the button for 3 seconds until, when the indicator turns red and flicker, it means workable. By short-pressing button, you can adjust soap volume with low, medium, high 3 volumes liquid. 4. Put your hand under the sensor or close the sensor ( light indicator), the soap will flow out. Package Included: 1 x Automatic Soap Dispenser","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lQHvneG2L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Danory","source_asin":"B075PBV754","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075PBV754","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075PBV754","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
