window.products.push({"id":804992,"name":"GuanTek AVKKVM Cooking Thermometer, RED","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dd9UEoFZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kitchen digital thermometer helps you easy to read food temperature with a clear LCD screen. data-hold function and Auto-off feature make it more smart. operation ①. press \"on/off\" To turn unit on. The LCD screen will turn on, display all options, then display current probe temperature. ②. probe is set to read temperatures in Celsius. To switch to Fahrenheit, press\"℃/ ºF\" Button. ③. data-hold: before withdrawing from food, press \"hold \"button. It will hold the temperature reading. ④. to test temperature, insert probe into thickest part of food. ⑤. current internal temperature of food shows on LCD screen. ⑥. unit will automatically turn off after 10 minutes if no other buttons are pressed. ⑦. to replace the battery, open the battery case as seen on the picture showed, battery type is LR44 or Ag13. warning: 1. Do not leave thermometer in oven while cooking, do not touch hot probe withe bare hands 2. Wash the metal probe in soap water. Clean thermometer by and. Do not completely immerse in water. Sterilize metal probe by inserting into boiling water for several minutes. nothings concept is based on Offering simple-designed, good quality, functional home and pet products at a reasonable prices. that contribute to helping more people and their pet live a better life at home. we and kitchenware N things","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dd9UEoFZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honbeanify","source_asin":"B073BCKKVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-804992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073BCKKVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073BCKKVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
